go6sim — third-party attribution
================================

This project redistributes data derived from Visual6502 in two places:

  ui/visualcpuwin/segdefs.go       die polygon table (8233 segments)
  ui/visualcpuwin/nodelocs.go      6502 node IDs (pads + register
                                   clusters) used for the live die view
                                   labels and overlay highlighting
  ui/visualcpuwin/render.go        per-layer color palette + alpha
                                   values mirroring expertWires.js

The transistor-level CPU backend in `cpu/netsim/` wraps
`github.com/carledwards/6502-netsim-go`, which itself ports the
Visual6502 transistor net.

